    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "A vertical column of brilliant fire roars down from above. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high Cylinder centered on a point within range makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 5d6 Fire damage and 5d6 Radiant damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.",
        "Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The Fire damage and the Radiant damage increase by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 5.",
        "* - (a pinch of sulfur)"
      ],
      "html": "<div> <p>A vertical column of brilliant fire roars down from above. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high <a>Cylinder</a> centered on a point within range makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 5d6 Fire damage and 5d6 Radiant damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p> <p><strong><em>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</em></strong> The Fire damage and the Radiant damage increase by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 5.</p> <span>* - (a pinch of sulfur)</span> </div>",
